+## Request 11: Payment recording
+**Status**: ✅ Completed and tested
+
+### What was done
+- Created `src/payments.js` with two functions:
+  - `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })` - adds payment to invoice
+  - `balanceDue(invoice)` - calculates remaining balance
+- Invoice status automatically transitions:
+  - 'issued' → 'partially_paid' after first payment
+  - 'partially_paid' → 'paid' when fully paid
+- Validation:
+  - NOT_ISSUED: rejects payments on draft or paid invoices
+  - AMOUNT_INVALID: requires positive integer amount
+  - OVERPAYMENT: rejects payments exceeding balance
+- Added error codes: NOT_ISSUED, OVERPAYMENT
+- Created payments array on first payment (creates if missing)
+- Added 14 comprehensive tests covering all scenarios
+
